AGENTS.md:7:OMNI Agent is a modular, async Python AI agent system that routes requests across 27 cloud LLM models. It supports four run modes: CLI, REST API (aiohttp on :8000), Telegram bot, and all-at-once. The system uses Ollama as its LLM backend with auto-routing to select the best model per task type (code, math, vision, multilingual, etc.).
AGENTS.md:19:pytest tests/ -v                   # All tests
AGENTS.md:20:pytest tests/test_models.py -v     # Model registry + router (canonical)
AGENTS.md:21:pytest tests/test_new_modules.py -v # RAG, cache, templates, pipeline
AGENTS.md:22:pytest tests/test_suite.py -v      # Core modules
AGENTS.md:23:pytest -k "test_name" -v           # Single test by name
AGENTS.md:26:docker-compose up -d               # omni-agent(:8000), ollama(:11434), searxng(:8080)
AGENTS.md:36:1. `OmniAgent.chat()` — main entry: security check → intent detection → skill triggers → history/summarization → optional RAG augmentation → cache check → LLM call → tool execution → memory extraction
